msgid "Visual Studio Code"
msgstr "Visual Studio Code"

msgid ""
"This documentation is for contributions to the game engine, and not using "
"Visual Studio Code as a C# or GDScript editor. To code C# or GDScript in an "
"external editor, see :ref:`the C# guide to configure an external editor "
"<doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>` or :ref:`the GDScript guide to using an "
"external text editor <doc_external_editor>`."
msgstr ""
"本文档主要针对的是为游戏引擎（本身）做贡献（比如参与引擎的 C++ 核心开发），而"
"不是教你如何使用 Visual Studio Code 来编写 C# 或 GDScript 游戏脚本。如果你想"
"在外部编辑器中编写 C# 或 GDScript 代码，请参见： :ref:`the C# guide to "
"configure an external editor <doc_c_sharp_setup_external_editor>` "
"或 :ref:`the GDScript guide to using an external text editor "
"<doc_external_editor>`。"

msgid ""
"`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com>`_ is a free cross-"
"platform code editor by `Microsoft <https://microsoft.com>`_ (not to be "
"confused with :ref:`doc_configuring_an_ide_vs`)."
msgstr ""
"`Visual Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com>`_ 是\\ `微软 <https://"
"microsoft.com>`_\\ 推出的免费跨平台代码编辑器（请勿"
"与 :ref:`doc_configuring_an_ide_vs` 混淆）。"

msgid "Importing the project"
msgstr "导入项目"

msgid ""
"Make sure the C/C++ extension is installed. You can find instructions in the "
"`official documentation <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/languages/"
"cpp>`_. Alternatively, `clangd <https://open-vsx.org/extension/llvm-vs-code-"
"extensions/vscode-clangd>`_ can be used instead."
msgstr ""
"确保已安装 C/C++ 扩展。你可以在\\ `官方文档 <https://code.visualstudio.com/"
"docs/languages/cpp>`_\\ 中找到说明。或者也可以用 `clangd <https://open-"
"vsx.org/extension/llvm-vs-code-extensions/vscode-clangd>`_ 代替。"

msgid "When using the clangd extension, run ``scons compiledb=yes``."
msgstr "使用 clangd 扩展时，请执行 ``scons compiledb=yes``\\ 。"

msgid ""
"From the Visual Studio Code's main screen open the Godot root folder with "
"**File > Open Folder...**."
msgstr ""
"在 Visual Studio Code 的主界面中，使用 **File > Open Folder...** 打开 Godot "
"根目录。"

msgid ""
"Press :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + P` to open the command prompt window and enter "
"*Configure Task*."
msgstr ""
"按 :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + P` 打开命令提示符窗口，然后输入 *Configure Task*\\ 。"

msgid "Select the **Create tasks.json file from template** option."
msgstr "选择 **Create tasks.json file from template** 选项。"

msgid "Then select **Others**."
msgstr "然后选择\\ **其他**\\ 。"

msgid ""
"If there is no such option as **Create tasks.json file from template** "
"available, either delete the file if it already exists in your folder or "
"create a ``.vscode/tasks.json`` file manually. See `Tasks in Visual Studio "
"Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/tasks#_custom-tasks>`_ for "
"more details on tasks."
msgstr ""
"如果找不到 **Create tasks.json file from template** （从模板创建 tasks.json "
"文件）这个选项，你可以尝试删除文件夹里已有的同名文件，或者手动创建一个 "
"``.vscode/tasks.json`` 文件。关于任务的更多详细信息，请参见 `Tasks in Visual "
"Studio Code <https://code.visualstudio.com/docs/editor/tasks#_custom-"
"tasks>`_ 。"

msgid ""
"Within the ``tasks.json`` file find the ``\"tasks\"`` array and add a new "
"section to it:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``tasks.json`` 文件中找到 ``\"tasks\"`` 数组, 并在其中添加一个新部分:"

msgid ".vscode/tasks.json"
msgstr ".vscode/tasks.json"

msgid "An example of a filled out ``tasks.json``."
msgstr "填好了 ``tasks.json`` 的一个例子."

msgid ""
"Arguments can be different based on your own setup and needs. "
"See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` for a full list of arguments."
msgstr ""
"参数可以根据你自己的设置和需要而不同. 参"
"见 :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` 以获取完整的参数列表."

msgid "Debugging the project"
msgstr "调试项目"

msgid ""
"To run and debug the project you need to create a new configuration in the "
"``launch.json`` file."
msgstr "为了构建项目, 我们需要配置文件 ``launch.json``."

msgid "Press :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + D` to open the Run panel."
msgstr "按 :kbd:`Ctrl + Shift + D` 打开“运行”面板。"

msgid ""
"If ``launch.json`` file is missing you will be prompted to create a new one."
msgstr "如果缺少 ``launch.json`` 文件, 系统会提示你创建一个新的文件."

msgid ""
"Select **C++ (GDB/LLDB)**. There may be another platform-specific option "
"here. If selected, adjust the configuration example provided accordingly."
msgstr ""
"请选择 **C++ (GDB/LLDB)** 。这里可能还会出现另一个针对特定平台的选项。如果选"
"了那个，请相应地调整系统提供的配置示例。"

msgid ""
"Within the ``launch.json`` file find the ``\"configurations\"`` array and "
"add a new section to it:"
msgstr ""
"在 ``launch.json`` 文件中找到 ``\"configurations\"`` 数组, 并添加一个新部分:"

msgid "An example of a filled out ``launch.json``."
msgstr "填写好的 ``launch.json`` 示例。"

msgid ""
"Due to sporadic performance issues, it is recommended to use LLDB over GDB "
"on Unix-based systems. Make sure that the `CodeLLDB extension <https://"
"marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=vadimcn.vscode-lldb>`_ is "
"installed for configurations using `lldb`."
msgstr ""
"由于 GDB 偶尔会出现性能问题，因此建议在基于 Unix 的系统上优先使用 LLDB 而不"
"是 GDB。请确保在使用 `lldb` 的配置中，已经安装了 `CodeLLDB extension "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=vadimcn.vscode-"
"lldb>`_ 。"

msgid ""
"If you encounter issues with lldb, you may consider using gdb (see the "
"LinuxBSD_gdb configuration)."
msgstr ""
"如果你在使用 lldb 时遇到了问题，可以考虑改用 gdb（具体可以查看 LinuxBSD_gdb "
"配置）。"

msgid ""
"Do note that lldb may work better with LLVM-based builds. "
"See :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` for further information."
msgstr ""
"请注意，lldb 调试器在使用基于 LLVM 的构建版本时，效果可能会更好。更多信息请参"
"见 :ref:`doc_compiling_for_linuxbsd` 。"

msgid ""
"The name under ``program`` depends on your build configuration, e.g. "
"``godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64`` for 64-bit LinuxBSD platform with "
"``target=editor`` and ``dev_build=yes``."
msgstr ""
"``program`` 下面的名称取决于你的构建配置。例如，针对 64 位 LinuxBSD 平台，如"
"果配置了 ``target=editor`` 和 ``dev_build=yes`` ，对应的名称就是 "
"``godot.linuxbsd.editor.dev.x86_64`` 。"

msgid "Configuring IntelliSense"
msgstr "配置 IntelliSense（智能感知）"

msgid "For the C/C++ extension:"
msgstr "对于 C/C++ 扩展："

msgid ""
"To fix include errors you may be having, you need to configure some settings "
"in the ``c_cpp_properties.json`` file."
msgstr ""
"如果你想修复可能遇到的 include（包含）错误，需要在 ``c_cpp_properties.json`` "
"文件里配置一些设置。"

msgid ""
"First, make sure to build the project since some files need to be generated."
msgstr "首先，请确保先构建（编译）一下项目，因为有些文件需要被自动生成出来。"

msgid "Edit the C/C++ Configuration file either with the UI or with text:"
msgstr ""
"你可以通过图形界面（UI）或者直接编辑文本的方式，来修改 C/C++ 配置文件："

msgid ""
"Add an include path for your platform, for example, ``${workspaceFolder}/"
"platform/windows``."
msgstr ""
"为你的平台添加一个包含路径（include path），例如 ``${workspaceFolder}/"
"platform/windows`` 。"

msgid ""
"Add defines for the editor ``TOOLS_ENABLED``, debug builds "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED``, and tests ``TESTS_ENABLED``."
msgstr ""
"添加以下宏定义：编辑器需要 ``TOOLS_ENABLED`` ，调试构建需要 "
"``DEBUG_ENABLED`` ，测试需要 ``TESTS_ENABLED`` 。"

msgid ""
"Make sure the compiler path is configured correctly to the compiler you are "
"using. See :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` for further "
"information on your platform."
msgstr ""
"请确保编译器路径已正确配置为你正在使用的那个编译器。关于你所在平台的更多详细"
"信息，请参见 :ref:`doc_introduction_to_the_buildsystem` 。"

msgid ""
"The ``c_cpp_properties.json`` file should look similar to this for Windows:"
msgstr "``c_cpp_properties.json`` 文件在 Windows 系统下应该类似于这样："

msgid ".vscode/c_cpp_properties.json"
msgstr ".vscode/c_cpp_properties.json"

msgid ""
"Alternatively, you can use the scons argument ``compiledb=yes`` and set the "
"compile commands setting ``compileCommands`` to ``compile_commands.json``, "
"found in the advanced section of the C/C++ Configuration UI."
msgstr ""
"你也可以使用 scons 参数 ``compiledb=yes`` 并将编译命令设置 "
"``compileCommands`` 设置为 ``compile_commands.json``\\ ，该设置可以在 C/C++ "
"配置界面的高级部分找到。"

msgid ""
"This argument can be added to your build task in ``tasks.json`` since it "
"will need to be run whenever files are added or moved."
msgstr ""
"这个参数可以添加到你 ``tasks.json`` 文件里的 build task（构建任务）中，因为每"
"当你添加或移动文件时，都需要重新运行它。"

msgid "Linting class reference XML files"
msgstr "对类参考的 XML 文件进行代码检查（Linting）"

msgid ""
"To get linting on class reference XML files, install the `vscode-xml "
"extension <https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=redhat.vscode-"
"xml>`__."
msgstr ""
"想要对类参考的 XML 文件进行代码检查（linting），请安装 `vscode-xml extension "
"<https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=redhat.vscode-xml>`__。"

msgid "Displaying documentation on hover"
msgstr "鼠标悬停时显示文档（注释）"

msgid ""
"By installing the `Godot Hover Docs extension <https://"
"marketplace.visualstudio.com/items?itemName=RedMser.godot-hover-docs>`__, "
"you can make class reference documentation appear when hovering symbols in C+"
"+ source or header files. The information is sourced from local XML files, "
"so it works offline."
msgstr ""
"通过安装 `Godot Hover Docs extension <https://marketplace.visualstudio.com/"
"items?itemName=RedMser.godot-hover-docs>`__，当你把鼠标悬停在 C++ 源文件或头"
"文件中的符号上时，就可以直接弹出显示类参考文档。这些文档信息是直接从本地的 "
"XML 文件中获取的，所以即使在没有网络（离线）的情况下也能正常使用。"

msgid ""
"This is only effective for symbols that are documented in the class "
"reference XML, i.e. those that are exposed to the scripting API. Internal "
"engine symbols will not show documentation on hover, unless they have a "
"comment right above their declaration."
msgstr ""
"这仅对 class reference XML 中已记录的符号有效，也就是那些暴露给脚本 API 的符"
"号。除非内部引擎符号在声明的正上方带有注释，否则在鼠标悬停时是不会显示文档提"
"示的。"

msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

msgid ""
"If you run into any issues, ask for help in one of `Godot's community "
"channels <https://godotengine.org/community>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果遇到问题, 也可在 `Godot 社区论坛 <https://godotengine.org/community>`__ "
"中寻求帮助."
